{"game": "sniper-elite-resistance", "language": "english", "appid": 2169200, "month": "2026-02", "window": 2, "start_date": 1770508800, "end_date": 1771113599, "month_true_total": 86, "quota": 7, "returned": 7, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 09:04:55 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "218330233", "author": {"steamid": "76561198312004850", "personaname": "ByeRoni", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ByeRoni/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 900, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 900, "last_played": 1767246551, "avatar": "2c189318ef03a30ed18c9321abe8b811fbd14174"}, "language": "english", "review": "This game was by far my least favorite Sniper Elite title. It’s clunky, short, and felt more like a chore than a game. It had its moments of fun, but they were too few and far between from getting stuck on a set of stairs to trying to get my character to move correctly to where I was trying to go, to some mission feeling the same, just on a different level. The whole game felt like a clunky mess. \n\nIf you like Sniper Elite games, this one may frustrate you, because it frustrated me lol\n\nIf you can find it on sale, I’d recommend it in the $10–$20 price range, but not at $49.99.", "timestamp_created": 1771103596, "timestamp_updated": 1771103596, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 24, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "218315500", "author": {"steamid": "76561197992184080", "personaname": "weatherman", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197992184080/", "num_games_owned": 168, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 19546, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "